NOTE
Cues narrate the silent inbox demo. A "⌨ <chord> — <text>" line renders as
a keycap chip plus description in the on-video overlay; plain lines are
context. Same file drives the native <track> captions and the overlay, so
they can't drift. Cues must fit inside the clip's runtime (~9.7s) — the
homepage-install caption test fails a cue that ends past the video.

